          Lipid Profile Report Explained: LDL, HDL, Total Cholesterol & Triglycerides
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Cardiovascular disease is the leading cause of death in India. Your lipid profile (cholesterol test) is one of the most important tests for heart health. Here is what every value means.
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-4 mt-6 text-xs text-muted font-mono">
          <span>📅 Oct 28, 2026</span><span>•</span><span>⏱ 9 min read</span><span>•</span><span>✅ Doctor-Reviewed</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <article class="py-16 bg-canvas px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto prose dark:prose-invert prose-sm sm:prose-base font-sans text-ink leading-relaxed">

